(2104, 296, 'подзаголовок', 'We invite you to participate in ‘Interfabric.B2B’ international textile marketplace to be held from 5 to 6 September in Expocentre Fairgrounds,\r\npavilion 2, Blue Hall.\r\n\r\nThe event will be held in dates of International CPM Exhibition (Collection Premiere Moscow).'),
(2105, 296, '_подзаголовок', 'field_5b3e55c582a36'),
(2106, 296, 'заголовок', ''),
(2107, 296, '_заголовок', 'field_5b3e55cd82a37'),
(2108, 296, 'описание', 'Participants of the event will be Russian and foreign manufacturers of fabrics and accessories, representatives of Russian and foreign brands of ready-to-wear, fashion houses, designers, owners of retail chains and wholesale companies. The main goal of the event is to ensure effective interaction of Russian and foreign manufacturers of fabrics and accessories with companies operating in various areas of light and textile industry (men&amp;#39;s and women&amp;#39;s clothing, costume group, children&amp;#39;s clothing and school uniforms, home clothes, underwear).'),
