(2326, 303, 'подзаголовок', 'We invite you to participate in ‘Interfabric.B2B’ international textile marketplace to be held from 5 to 6 September in Expocentre Fairgrounds,\r\npavilion 2, Blue Hall.\r\n\r\nThe event will be held in dates of International CPM Exhibition (Collection Premiere Moscow).'),
