(2330, 303, 'описание', 'Participants of the event will be Russian and foreign manufacturers of fabrics and accessories, representatives of Russian and foreign brands of ready-to-wear, fashion houses, designers, owners of retail chains and wholesale companies. The main goal of the event is to ensure effective interaction of Russian and foreign manufacturers of fabrics and accessories with companies operating in various areas of light and textile industry (men&amp;#39;s and women&amp;#39;s clothing, costume group, children&amp;#39;s clothing and school uniforms, home clothes, underwear).\r\n\r\nFORMAT OF THE EVENT: business meetings in B2B format, personal negotiations, demonstration of products directly to managers who decide on procurement'),
