(307, 1, '2018-07-20 15:13:53', '2018-07-20 12:13:53', 'Participation is very useful, necessary. We could talk eye to eye\r\nwith the purchasers of retail chains, evaluate and compare their\r\nproposal with potential competitors. The event was held at a good\r\norganizational level!', 'Lyudmila Pleshakova, Director for Strategic Development of SEWING ENTERPRISE DIANA', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'lyudmila-pleshakova-director-for-strategic-development-of-sewing-enterprise-diana', '', '', '2018-07-20 15:13:53', '2018-07-20 12:13:53', '', 0, 'http://b2b.aliveliyev.com/?post_type=reviews&#038;p=307', 0, 'reviews', '', 0),
(308, 1, '2018-07-20 15:14:24', '2018-07-20 12:14:24', 'Participation in the session provided an opportunity to\r\nmeet with trade networks, exchange contacts, some of\r\nthem are already actively working on mutually beneficial\r\ncooperation. We will definitely take part in the next\r\nsession!', 'Victoria Eremina, Key Account Manager, TM  КоtМаrКоt', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'victoria-eremina-key-account-manager-tm-%d0%ba%d0%bet%d0%bc%d0%b0r%d0%ba%d0%bet', '', '', '2018-07-20 15:14:24', '2018-07-20 12:14:24', '', 0, 'http://b2b.aliveliyev.com/?post_type=reviews&#038;p=308', 0, 'reviews', '', 0),
(309, 1, '2018-07-20 15:15:13', '2018-07-20 12:15:13', 'Very convenient and useful format of negotiations with potential\r\ncustomers directly. In a personal meeting, not only the conditions\r\nof work and delivery of products were discussed, but also the\r\npossibility of a unique production of a certain group of goods. We\r\nplan to participate in the next session!', 'Dmitry Glebov, head of sales department of LAKASATEKS', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'dmitry-glebov-head-of-sales-department-of-lakasateks', '', '', '2018-07-20 15:15:13', '2018-07-20 12:15:13', '', 0, 'http://b2b.aliveliyev.com/?post_type=reviews&#038;p=309', 0, 'reviews', '', 0),
