(315, 1, '2018-07-20 15:18:33', '2018-07-20 12:18:33', 'It was very useful to conduct direct contacts with representatives\r\nof factories and fabric manufacturers, understand their size and\r\ncapacity, assess the quality of products, future opportunities, so to\r\nspeak, personally. Everything was organized very professionally', 'Dmitry Klimkin, an expert at MitsubishiCorporationRussia (LLC), a partner of Uniqlo', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'dmitry-klimkin-an-expert-at-mitsubishicorporationrussia-llc-a-partner-of-uniqlo', '', '', '2018-07-20 15:18:33', '2018-07-20 12:18:33', '', 0, 'http://b2b.aliveliyev.com/?post_type=reviews&#038;p=315', 0, 'reviews', '', 0),
