our company\'s production activities (fabrics, home textiles and medical products) new products are constantly being introduced into the range of products - so, recently a boiled linen appeared in the segment of linen fabrics; home textile assortment is expanded by the issuance of new collections, and in medical products - for specific needs of the customer.\r\n\r\nSoon it is planned to complete the implementation of a large-scale investment project to create a high-tech production of bandages. All these trends are due to the demand for this product - both partner enterprises and mass consumers. All contracts are carried out in strict accordance with the schedule and requests of the clientele, incl. trading networks.\r\n\r\nDuring the forthcoming INTERFABRIC exhibition ‘TDL Textile’ will exhibit natural fabrics - cotton, linen and semi-linen; printed and jacquard, as well as home textiles made of cotton and linen in a wide range. We are confident that this product will cause interest from the entrepreneurial, consumer and expert communities. \"\r\n\r\n<strong> <em> You can get acquainted with the company\'s products at the ‘INTERFABRIC-2018.Autumn’ exhibition from August 27 to August 30, 2018, in the Expocentre Fairgrounds, in Pavilion 3, stand B01. </ em> </ strong>.\r\n', 'TDL Textiles: with love to the business, with care for customers', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '323-revision-v1', '', '', '2018-07-22 14:33:01', '2018-07-22 11:33:01', '', 323, 'http://b2b.aliveliyev.com/323-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(357, 1, '2018-07-22 14:36:44', '2018-07-22 11:36:44', '<strong> Mitwill Design Community </strong> is a designer network that develops a collection of unique fashion prints. With a global sourcing network and production partnerships, <strong> Mitwill Textiles Europe </strong> contributes to the success of its customers and is an industrial partner through cooperation with leading European printing facilities.\nCustomers are followed by a member of the design team to manage the exchange with the design network for special requests and custom print themes.\nMitwill Textiles Europe  – more than 10 000 new designs created in the last 4 years, production site for 150 000 m monthly printing. Mitwill Designer Community grows to over 40 active designers.\nProduction capacity at partner mills grows to 8 – 9 mill. meters of prints annually.\nMitwill Strengths\nManagement of a designer network and development of print collections\nOrganisation of production, logistics, distribution\nDevelopment of process software\nInternational Sourcing\nCustomer portfolio\n<strong><em>You can get acquainted with the company’s products at the ‘INTERFABRIC-2018.Autumn’ exhibition from August 27 to August 30, 2018, in the Expocentre Fairgrounds, in pavilion 3, booth K02.</em></strong>\nMitwill Design Community – дизайнерская сеть, которая разрабатывает коллекцию уникальных модных принтов.\n\nБлагодаря глобальной сети поставщиков и производственных партнерств <strong>Mitwill Textiles Europe</strong> способствует успеху своих клиентов и является промышленным партнером посредством сотрудничества с ведущими Европейскими типографиями.\n\nС клиентами работает член команды разработчиков для управления обменом с проектной сетью по специальным запросам и пользовательским темам для печати.\n\n<strong>Mitwill Textiles Europe</strong> –  это более 10 000 новых дизайнов, созданных за последние 4 года, производственная площадка для ежемесячной печати 150 000 м. Сообщество дизайнеров Mitwill составляет более 40 активных дизайнеров, а производственные мощности на партнерских заводах растут до 8-9 млн. метров принтов ежегодно.\n\n<strong>Сильные стороны Mitwill:</strong>\n\n– Управление дизайнерской сетью и разработка печатных коллекций\n\n– Организация производства, логистика, дистрибуция\n\n– Разработка программного обеспечения для процесса\n\n– Международный поиск\n\n– Портфолио клиентов\n\n<strong><em>Ознакомиться с продукцией компании можно на выставке «ИНТЕРТКАНЬ-2018.Осень» с 27 по 30 августа 2018 года,  в ЦВК «Экспоцентр», в павильоне №3, стенд K02.</em></strong>', 'Prints from Mitwill Design Community', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '318-autosave-v1', '', '', '2018-07-22 14:36:44', '2018-07-22 11:36:44', '', 318, 'http://b2b.aliveliyev.com/318-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(358, 1, '2018-07-22 14:37:53', '2018-07-22 11:37:53', '<strong> Mitwill Design Community </strong> is a designer network that develops a collection of unique fashion prints. With a global sourcing network and production partnerships, <strong> Mitwill Textiles Europe </strong> contributes to the success of its customers and is an industrial partner through cooperation with leading European printing facilities.\r\nCustomers are followed by a member of the design team to manage the exchange with the design network for special requests and custom print themes.\r\n<strong>Mitwill Textiles Europe</strong> – more than 10 000 new designs created in the last 4 years, production site for 150 000 m monthly printing. Mitwill Designer Community grows to over 40 active designers.\r\nProduction capacity at partner mills grows to 8 – 9 mill. meters of prints annually.\r\nMitwill Strengths\r\n-Management of a designer network and development of print collections\r\n-Organisation of production, logistics, distribution\r\n-Development of process software\r\n-International Sourcing\r\n-Customer portfolio\r\n<strong><em>You can get acquainted with the company’s products at the ‘INTERFABRIC-2018.Autumn’ exhibition from August 27 to August 30, 2018, in the Expocentre Fairgrounds, in pavilion 3, stand K02.</em></strong>', 'Prints from Mitwill Design Community', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '318-revision-v1', '', '', '2018-07-22 14:37:53', '2018-07-22 11:37:53', '', 318, 'http://b2b.aliveliyev.com/318-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
